# Skillgrp.dat of Essence 563 and later: the table of Essence 542 with four bytes for the automatic use of a macro,
# where Essence 542 has one. The tables of E563 read so, in its three worlds.
format  1
file    Skillgrp.dat
title   Essence 563 and later
like    Essence 542 and later

replace macros.automaticUse {
    uint    automaticUse        # 1 to 3 in the files of the game
}
